Add `moved: false` and in pointermove set moved if abs>4. On pointerup call endDrag(event, {allowClick:true}).

```js
let dragging = null;
const DRAG_THRESHOLD = 4;
...
dragging = { x, y, moved: false };
pointermove: const dx..., if (Math.abs(event.clientX - dragging.x) ... ) hmm dragging.x is updated each move. Track start and moved:
dragging = { startX, startY, x, y, moved:false }
if (!dragging.moved && Math.hypot(event.clientX - dragging.startX, event.clientY - dragging.startY) > 4) dragging.moved = true;
```

endDrag:
```js
const endDrag = (event, { allowClick = false } = {}) => {
  if (!dragging) return;
  const wasClick = allowClick && !dragging.moved;
